<h2>How we picked the 8 tools</h2>
      <img src="/images/blog/best-ai-tools-for-product-managers-2026/inline-1.webp" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/blog/best-ai-tools-for-product-managers-2026/inline-1.jpg'" alt="How we picked the 8 tools" loading="lazy" /><p>We surveyed 50 product managers across 30 companies, asking: which AI tools do you use daily, which save the most time, and which would you pay for out of pocket?</p><h2>Tool 1: ChatGPT Team (\/user/month)</h2>
      <img src="/images/blog/best-ai-tools-for-product-managers-2026/inline-2.webp" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/blog/best-ai-tools-for-product-managers-2026/inline-2.jpg'" alt="Tool 1: ChatGPT Team (\/user/month)" loading="lazy" /><p>The workhorse. 90% of the PMs we surveyed use ChatGPT daily.</p><h2>Tool 2: Claude Pro (\/month)</h2>
      <img src="/images/blog/best-ai-tools-for-product-managers-2026/inline-3.webp" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/blog/best-ai-tools-for-product-managers-2026/inline-3.jpg'" alt="Tool 2: Claude Pro (\/month)" loading="lazy" /><p>The reasoning engine. 70% of PMs use Claude weekly.</p><h2>Tool 3: Perplexity Pro (\/month)</h2><p>The research tool. 60% of PMs use Perplexity weekly.</p><h2>Tool 4: Notion AI (\/month)</h2><p>The workspace AI. 50% of PMs use Notion AI daily.</p><h2>Tool 5: Miro AI (\/month add-on)</h2><p>The whiteboard AI. 40% of PMs use Miro AI weekly.</p><h2>Tool 6: Loom AI (\/month)</h2><p>The async video tool. 30% of PMs use Loom AI daily.</p><h2>Tool 7: Dovetail (\/month)</h2><p>The research repository. 25% of PMs use Dovetail weekly.</p><h2>Tool 8: Productboard AI (\/month)</h2><p>The roadmap tool. 20% of PMs use Productboard AI weekly.</p><h2>The 5 workflows that work</h2><p>Workflow 1: PRD writing (60% faster). Workflow 2: Customer interview synthesis (75% faster). Workflow 3: Competitive analysis (50% faster). Workflow 4: Meeting summaries (90% faster). Workflow 5: Stakeholder updates (70% faster).</p><h2>Bottom line</h2><p>Start with ChatGPT + Claude + Notion AI (\/month total) and add the rest as needed.</p>
